INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_CIV','The Republic of Pigeons');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_CIV5_HEADING_1','A Republic Above the Streets');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_CIV5_TEXT_1','The Republic of Pigeons began as a loose compact among the rooftop roosts of Coopolis. Each tower kept its own customs, but every tower depended on messages from the next. When a winter storm scattered the couriers, the surviving roosts agreed that no letter should be abandoned merely because its destination stood beyond another flock''s eaves.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]From that promise grew a republic. Its assemblies meet on broad parapets; its laws are sealed with wax and, occasionally, a footprint. Caravan masters fund the relay stations, scholars exchange observations through them, and visiting artists discover an audience at every stop. Its citizens consider reliable correspondence both a public service and the foundation of civilized life.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]The Republic is an original fictional civilization. Its history celebrates communication, curiosity and the unlikely dignity of ordinary city birds.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_CIV_PEDIA','The Republic of Pigeons began as a loose compact among the rooftop roosts of Coopolis. Each tower kept its own customs, but every tower depended on messages from the next. When a winter storm scattered the couriers, the surviving roosts agreed that no letter should be abandoned merely because its destination stood beyond another flock''s eaves.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]From that promise grew a republic. Its assemblies meet on broad parapets; its laws are sealed with wax and, occasionally, a footprint. Caravan masters fund the relay stations, scholars exchange observations through them, and visiting artists discover an audience at every stop. Its citizens consider reliable correspondence both a public service and the foundation of civilized life.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]The Republic is an original fictional civilization. Its history celebrates communication, curiosity and the unlikely dignity of ordinary city birds.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_COO_HEADING_1','From Chimney Clerk to Statesbird');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_COO_LIVED','The Age of Open Correspondence');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_COO_NAME','Postmaster General Coo');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_COO_SUBTITLE','Keeper of the Public Post');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_COO_TEXT_1','Before becoming Postmaster General, Coo maintained the least fashionable relay in Coopolis: a wind-battered chimney overlooking the grain market. Coo made it indispensable by delivering every message, including complaints addressed to the wrong tower.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Elected after the Great Misdelivery, Coo standardized postal seals, opened the courier colleges and required public officials to answer their correspondence. Behind the ceremonial cap and solemn coo lies a patient negotiator who prefers a signed agreement to a sharpened beak. Yet the General keeps watch over the caravan roads: a republic that cannot defend its messengers cannot keep its promises.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_COO_TITLES_1','Postmaster General');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_DAWN','Attend, Postmaster General Coo! From the chimneys of Coopolis to the towers beyond the horizon, your citizens await the morning mail. Where others see scattered rooftops, you see a republic joined by trust, curiosity and tireless wings.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Send your Carrier Pigeons into unfamiliar skies. Raise Rooftop Roosts above busy caravan yards, and let each departing messenger bring knowledge and culture home. Will your correspondence unite the world, and will your republic take its place among the enduring civilizations?');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_DEFEAT_1','Our roosts lie empty, our messages undelivered. Even the mightiest wings must someday rest.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_DUMMY','Postal network');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_DUMMY_HELP','Automatically maintained from active outgoing land Trade Routes.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_GREETING_1','Greetings, stranger. I am Postmaster General Coo, guardian of every message that takes wing. May our correspondence be fruitful, and our breadcrumbs plentiful.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_LEADER','Postmaster General Coo');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_LEADER_PEDIA','Before becoming Postmaster General, Coo maintained the least fashionable relay in Coopolis: a wind-battered chimney overlooking the grain market. Coo made it indispensable by delivering every message, including complaints addressed to the wrong tower.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Elected after the Great Misdelivery, Coo standardized postal seals, opened the courier colleges and required public officials to answer their correspondence. Behind the ceremonial cap and solemn coo lies a patient negotiator who prefers a signed agreement to a sharpened beak. Yet the General keeps watch over the caravan roads: a republic that cannot defend its messengers cannot keep its promises.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_PEACE_1','Then let the next message carry an olive branch. Our roosts shall welcome peaceful correspondence once more.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_ROOST','Rooftop Roost');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_ROOST_HELP','Replaces the Caravansary and retains all of its normal benefits. +1 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture. While this city has at least one active outgoing LAND Trade Route, it also gains +2 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production. This Production bonus does not stack with additional routes. Sea routes and incoming routes do not activate it.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_ROOST_PEDIA','Above each bustling caravan yard stands a sheltered roost, where postal clerks sort letters and couriers compare crumbs. The daily traffic brings new songs, stories and practical ideas to the city below. When caravans leave the gates, rooftop workshops turn that correspondence into useful work.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_ROOST_STRATEGY','Build Rooftop Roosts in your land trade origins. One outgoing caravan activates the full +2 Production; additional caravans still multiply Messages on the Wing. Protect the routes to keep the workshops busy.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SHORT','Pigeon Republic');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SIGHT','Postal Lookout');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SIGHT_HELP','+1 Sight. A watchful courier misses neither a distant tower nor an approaching threat.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_1','Dead Letter');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_10','Return Address');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_2','Quiet Quill');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_3','Grey Seal');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_4','Night Courier');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_5','Soft Landing');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_6','Hidden Perch');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_7','Black Ink');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_8','Second Post');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_SPY_9','Loose Feather');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_STRATEGY','Explore early with Carrier Pigeons, then establish protected land Trade Routes. Concentrate several routes in a strong origin for stacked Science and Culture, or spread them among Rooftop Roost cities to activate several Production bonuses. Internal routes support growth while still earning the UA. Reach the Renaissance to improve every qualifying route. Favor Science, then Culture and Diplomacy; maintain enough defense to keep the correspondence moving.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_TRAIT','Messages on the Wing');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_TRAIT_HELP','Each active outgoing LAND Trade Route grants its origin city +2 [ICON_RESEARCH] Science and +2 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture. These bonuses increase to +3 each upon reaching the Renaissance Era. Domestic and international routes qualify; multiple routes stack. Sea routes and incoming routes do not qualify.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_UNIT','Carrier Pigeon');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_UNIT_HELP','Replaces the Scout. +1 Sight compared with the standard Scout. Ignores terrain movement costs, preserving the Scout''s reconnaissance role, promotions, ancient ruin benefits and upgrade path. Normal impassable terrain and embarkation rules apply.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_UNIT_PEDIA','Every Carrier Pigeon takes the postal oath: neither rain, nor hills, nor a particularly interesting statue shall delay the mail. These intrepid messengers survey distant lands with an eye for good routes and an even sharper eye for unattended grain. The battlefield model uses the standard Scout for clear reconnaissance behavior.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_UNIT_STRATEGY','Send Carrier Pigeons ahead to meet neighbors, locate ancient ruins and identify safe land trade destinations. Their extra sight helps watch approaches, but their combat strength remains that of a Scout.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_PIGEON_WAR_1','You have intercepted our correspondence for the last time. The skies themselves shall carry our displeasure!');
